# DC-1 stale-property migration.
#
# Early builds seeded persist.sys.sf.color_saturation=0.0, which forces
# CLIENT (GPU) composition of every frame on this MTK HWC (no hardware
# overlays -> 120Hz jank). The persist value lives on /data and survives
# system reflashes, so rewrite exactly the stale value to the SF default.
# A user-chosen non-0.0 value is never touched. Fires at persist-prop load
# (post-fs-data), long before SurfaceFlinger reads it at boot-finished.

on property:persist.sys.sf.color_saturation=0.0
    setprop persist.sys.sf.color_saturation 1.0
